  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Recruit 20,000 more nurses and 10,000 more doctors; faster NHS treatment free at point of use; raise the minimum wage to £4.20; retain winter fuel payments for pensioners; expand police numbers and reform criminal justice to improve detection, punishment and rehabilitation; restructure benefits to support people into work.\nTEXT_D: Recruit 27,500 nurses and 4,600 doctors; free personal care for elderly/long-term patients; restore free dental and eye checks and move toward scrapping prescription charges; Pharmaceutical Agency to end postcode lottery; Patient Care Guarantees and independent advocacy; abolish university tuition fees and restore grants; minimum wage full rate from 16 and reduce tax on the lowest paid; free off-peak buses for pensioners/disabled and half-price for under-19s; Equality Act and Equality Commission; civil partnership registration; independent police complaints system and shift toward rehabilitation over prison expansion; strong environmental measures (carbon tax, CO2 cuts, recycling).",
